            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.41

- New app icon. The old one showed a record and sound waves, which said very little about what Now actually does. The new icon shows three lyric lines with the middle one lit, which is the app in a single image: the line that is playing right now. There are light and dark versions, and the icon follows your system appearance as before.
]]></description>
