            <link>https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>147</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.40</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.40

- A track name or artist too long for the overlay now fades out softly at the right edge instead of being cut off mid letter. The title still makes its one scrolling pass to reveal the full name, and now its resting state reads as intentional rather than looking like something failed to draw. Text that fits is unchanged and stays crisp to its last character.
]]></description>
            <enclosure url="https://github.com/LakshyaSingh/now-updates/releases/download/v2.13.40/Now-2.13.40.zip" length="3542871" type="application/octet-stream" sparkle:edSignature="trh0NFssi6LkiRHM6k7xUBQ72N77ERRYeqrb+E+zZ7oDkGBvUJhspj9bx+PEZYYfjCHF+p2CObGQLD0dspNhDw=="/>
