            <sparkle:version>146</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.13.39</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>10.13</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Now 2.13.39

- Clicking the Dock icon while the full screen view is open now returns to that view instead of opening Settings. Settings was appearing on the desktop while the view you clicked back to sat on its own space, so it had to be hunted down. Settings still opens from the Dock icon when the full screen view is closed.
]]></description>
